Current selected baseline: `surface.islandNativeBlur: false`; custom island masks use exact translucent fills, while the rounded right-control-center native blur remains enabled. No services, routing, input, focus, Escape, or multi-monitor behavior changes.

Rationale: the disabled path now clears generated `Region` slices once and returns before all later geometry-triggered rebuilds, preventing dynamic Region churn. Re-enabling resets the gate and uses the existing equations unchanged; visual/input masks, RCC blur, BarSection layers, animation timing, and monitor behavior are unaffected.
